ls:['God notices the faithful in small, ordinary fields.','Loyalty and love can change history.','God welcomes outsiders.','Redemption costs someone something.'],
rd:[['The choice','Ruth 1:6-18'],['The gleaning','Ruth 2'],['The redemption','Ruth 4'],['The ancestry','Matthew 1:1-6']],
