wk:['Scripture records no moral failure; he confesses the sins of his people as his own (Daniel 9:5)'],
jx:'The "Son of Man" coming with the clouds receiving an everlasting kingdom (Daniel 7:13-14) is Jesus\' favourite title for Himself (Mark 14:62). The fourth man in the furnace "like a son of the gods" and the stone cut without hands (Daniel 2:34, 45) point to His presence and kingdom.',
ls:['Decide in advance what you will not compromise.','Pray consistently, even when it is costly.','God rules over empires and kings.','Serve the culture you live in without being shaped by it.'],
