pl:['Courage under pressure','Wisdom: planned two banquets','Humble obedience to Mordecai, then bold initiative','Faith expressed in fasting'],
wk:['Initially hid her identity','Hesitated at first to speak up (Esther 4:10-12)'],
jx:'Esther stood between her people and death at the risk of her life, a pointer to Christ, who stands for us before the throne (Hebrews 7:25). God is not named in the book, yet His providence fills it.',
