jx:'Jesus called "the sign of Jonah" His own death and resurrection (Matthew 12:39-41). He is the greater Jonah: He went voluntarily into the storm of judgement for us, and rose after three days. The repentance of Nineveh condemns those who refuse the One greater than Jonah.',
